# Cloudflare Pages redirects

#

# CATATAN: domain-level redirect (www.formspec.dev → formspec.dev) TIDAK bisa

# lewat \_redirects (source wajib path relatif, domain redirect tidak didukung).

# Gunakan Redirect Rule di dashboard Cloudflare:

# Rules → Redirect Rules → www.formspec.dev/* → https://formspec.dev/:splat (301)

# URL yang didokumentasikan CLI (docs/cli-tools/02-formspec-cli.md §2):

# formspec.dev/schemas/... → schemas.formspec.dev/...

/schemas/\* https://schemas.formspec.dev/:splat 302
